# You hae to wait for the next canonical hour and listen to Lot
# announce the new password. (You can type wait for [next hour],
# e.g., if it is Terce, wait for sext.) The necessary poem is
# printed in the front of the Book of Hours that came with the
# game. He always chooses a line from the third verse, which is
# No king so fair / by maid begot / was ever there / than good King Lot.
